5-aa4a-4bd3-9a00-732512921c1c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"`scheme@(guile-user)\u0026gt;` 厳密に言うとこれがプロンプトですが、多分伝わりそう","ts":"1629564908.070900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0Qcj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4cf36998-cc96-44fe-932d-fcb8b814f11e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"プロンプトでも間違いではなさそう","ts":"1629564879.069800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Stloc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"84091377-38fc-4d19-9b6b-3f72e7b668e9","type":"message","user":"U022E2B9KRD","text":"\u0026gt; REPL\nこの言葉、初めて知った。恥ずかしや...\nこれ系、いつも、プロンプトと呼んでました。:joy:","ts":"1629564846.069500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QA="}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b5f5e72-2527-4362-9108-dca2d6c2da42","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"いわゆるREPLですね","ts":"1629564721.068200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UhZtt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"579ef7f6-04ba-4661-9c3d-a5acfc44ab88","type":"message","user":"U022E2B9KRD","text":"guile install 出来ました。\nこのプロンプトで、scheme の簡易コード確認できるんですね。\n```yama@JPC20165182 /c/T/Log\u0026gt; guile\nGNU Guile 2.2.7\nCopyright (C) 1995-2019 Free Software Foundation, Inc.\n\nGuile comes with ABSOLUTELY NO WARRANTY; for details type `,show w'.\nThis program is free software, and you are welcome to redistribute it\nunder certain conditions; type `,show c' for details.\n\nEnter `,help' for help.\nscheme@(guile-user)\u0026gt;```","ts":"1629564702.068000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a7nw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"51917062-429d-4473-947a-9c78012c874e","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"EmacsもElisp捨ててこれにしようぜという話だけあります。","ts":"1629564684.067700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OWbF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"72cee625-30f2-4d0b-9db5-acc9af53bc66","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"(Gaucheすごく面倒臭かった)","ts":"1629564675.067300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tag"}]},{"client_msg_id":"94a4b58a-9c96-4c36-811e-26e0008792e2","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ほほー、Gaucheの組み込みより簡単そう","ts":"1629564658.066700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eRuD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7bcd58f5-bcdc-4e10-b7ae-41b3355d22a2","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ちなみに話を出したのでもうちょっと話すとguileはこうやって簡単[要出典]に入れ込むことができるんですよね。便利。\n\u003chttps://www.gnu.org/software/guile/manual/html_node/Linking-Guile-into-Programs.html\u003e","ts":"1629564624.065900","attachments":[{"fallback":"Linking Guile into Programs (Guile Reference Manual)","id":1,"title":"Linking Guile into Programs (Guile Reference Manual)","title_link":"https://www.gnu.org/software/guile/manual/html_node/Linking-Guile-into-Programs.html","text":"Linking Guile into Programs (Guile Reference Manual)","blocks":null,"service_name":"gnu.org","service_icon":"https://www.gnu.org/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://www.gnu.org/software/guile/manual/html_node/Linking-Guile-into-Programs.html","original_url":"https://www.gnu.org/software/guile/manual/html_node/Linking-Guile-into-Programs.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EKdE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bbccd6a7-6f76-4d52-b54b-83c2142faad3","type":"message","user":"U022E2B9KRD","text":"\u0026gt; guileはないですかね？\n有りました。\n```yama@JPC20165182 /c/T/Log [1]\u0026gt; pacman -Ss guile\nmsys/guile 2.2.7-1\n    a portable, embeddable Scheme implementation written in C\nmsys/libguile 2.2.7-1 (libraries) [installed]\n    a portable, embeddable Scheme implementation written in C\nmsys/libguile-devel 2.2.7-1 (development)\n    a portable, embeddable Scheme implementation written in C```","ts":"1629564564.065700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HOO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41f18126-60cd-4b63-8d7d-f07771e81edf","type":"message","user":"U022E2B9KRD","text":"\u003chttp://practical-scheme.net/gauche/download-j.html\u003e\nがヒットしました。\nWindouws msi installer が有るようです。","ts":"1629564464.064500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xbxN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78d632b1-63f9-47d3-b89e-c36c8b4abbcf","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"(MSYS全く分からない。yay的なものはないのか？)","ts":"1629564414.063700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9Dn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5b7ebbc-9790-4656-ae13-ec6a45f7a1ac","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"guileはないですかね？これもschemeです。","ts":"1629564391.063400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7ny"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d73c395a-8b41-4d0a-bd27-f353c3a5d05b","type":"message","user":"U022E2B9KRD","text":"MSYS2 package にはなさそうなので、またの機会(多分...いれないだろうなぁ) にします。\nせっかく教示いただいたのにすんません。\nEmacs lisp 精進します！\n```yama@JPC20165182 /c/T/Log\u0026gt; pacman -Ss gauche\nyama@JPC20165182 /c/T/Log [1]\u0026gt;```","ts":"1629564341.063100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CEs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"255f108c-c528-408a-ad87-fcaa20dd9ed2","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"まぁLispを使う人よりLisp処理系の方が多いって言われてる界隈なので仕方ない (?)","ts":"1629564332.062800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/eeV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c946d309-b88c-48b8-a0fa-f16f8de5e00f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"一応その中にあるchickenとguileはSchemeの処理系ですね","ts":"1629564296.062000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4cdv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b9a0d89d-7246-44f7-b731-58434ed5e6eb","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"schemeは仕様の名前なので、schemeっていう処理系はないんですよね。。難しい。","ts":"1629564255.060800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l/="}]},{"client_msg_id":"19463572-0b99-43c9-849e-c9ad9ebe7b6c","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"goshはコマンド名なので、多分gaucheで登録されてると思います。","ts":"1629564186.060100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"aruaru","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m+x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08bf68b9-7233-4f18-aae8-eaf149dc03b5","type":"message","user":"U022E2B9KRD","text":"Windows 環境 Emacs 28 (gnu ftp siteから取得) ですが、\n```Emacs 内部で gosh を起動させる手順:\n\n.emacs に (setq scheme-program-name \"gosh -i\") と書いて保存\nM-x run-scheme を実行```\ngosh をどっかから取得しないとダメなんですね。\nMSYS2 gosh 探したけどなくて..\n```yama@JPC20165182 /c/T/Log\u0026gt; pacman -Ss gosh```\nscheme だと、引っ掛かるので、どれか入れれば、gosh インストールされるのかなぁ？\n```yama@JPC20165182 /c/T/Log [1]\u0026gt; pacman -Ss scheme\nmingw32/mingw-w64-i686-chicken 4.12.0-1\n    Feature rich R5RS Scheme compiler and interpreter (mingw-w64)\nmingw32/mingw-w64-i686-crypto++ 8.4.0-2\n    Crypto++ Library is a free C++ class library of cryptographic schemes (mingw-w64)\nmingw32/mingw-w64-i686-docbook-mathml 1.1CR1-3\n    MathML XML scheme (mingw-w64)\nmingw32/mingw-w64-i686-docbook-xml 1~4.5-2\n    A widely used XML scheme for writing documentation and help\nmingw32/mingw-w64-i686-libbdplus 0.1.2-1\n    Library for handling the BD+ protection scheme on bluray discs (mingw-w64)\nmingw32/mingw-w64-i686-python-semantic-version 2.8.5-1\n    A library implementing the 'SemVer' scheme (mingw-w64)\nmingw32/mingw-w64-i686-w3c-mathml2 2.0-1\n    MathML XML scheme (mingw-w64)\nmingw64/mingw-w64-x86_64-chicken 4.12.0-1\n    Feature rich R5RS Scheme compiler and interpreter (mingw-w64)\nmingw64/mingw-w64-x86_64-crypto++ 8.4.0-2\n    Crypto++ Library is a free C++ class library of cryptographic schemes (mingw-w64)\nmingw64/mingw-w64-x86_64-docbook-mathml 1.1CR1-3\n    MathML XML scheme (mingw-w64)\nmingw64/mingw-w64-x86_64-docbook-xml 1~4.5-2\n    A widely used XML scheme for writing documentation and help\nmingw64/mingw-w64-x86_64-libbdplus 0.1.2-1\n    Library for handling the BD+ protection scheme on bluray discs (mingw-w64)\nmingw64/mingw-w64-x86_64-python-semantic-version 2.8.5-1\n    A library implementing the 'SemVer' scheme (mingw-w64)\nmingw64/mingw-w64-x86_64-w3c-mathml2 2.0-1\n    MathML XML scheme (mingw-w64)\nucrt64/mingw-w64-ucrt-x86_64-chicken 4.12.0-1\n    Feature rich R5RS Scheme compiler and interpreter (mingw-w64)\nucrt64/mingw-w64-ucrt-x86_64-crypto++ 8.4.0-2\n    Crypto++ Library is a free C++ class library of cryptographic schemes (mingw-w64)\nucrt64/mingw-w64-ucrt-x86_64-docbook-mathml 1.1CR1-3\n    MathML XML scheme (mingw-w64)\nucrt64/mingw-w64-ucrt-x86_64-docbook-xml 1~4.5-2\n    A widely used XML scheme for writing documentation and help\nucrt64/mingw-w64-ucrt-x86_64-libbdplus 0.1.2-1\n    Library for handling the BD+ protection scheme on bluray discs (mingw-w64)\nucrt64/mingw-w64-ucrt-x86_64-python-semantic-version 2.8.5-1\n    A library implementing the 'SemVer' scheme (mingw-w64)\nucrt64/mingw-w64-ucrt-x86_64-w3c-mathml2 2.0-1\n    MathML XML scheme (mingw-w64)\nclang64/mingw-w64-clang-x86_64-crypto++ 8.4.0-2\n    Crypto++ Library is a free C++ class library of cryptographic schemes (mingw-w64)\nclang64/mingw-w64-clang-x86_64-docbook-mathml 1.1CR1-3\n    MathML XML scheme (mingw-w64)\nclang64/mingw-w64-clang-x86_64-docbook-xml 1~4.5-2\n    A widely used XML scheme for writing documentation and help\nclang64/mingw-w64-clang-x86_64-libbdplus 0.1.2-1\n    Library for handling the BD+ protection scheme on bluray discs (mingw-w64)\nclang64/mingw-w64-clang-x86_64-python-semantic-version 2.8.5-1\n    A library implementing the 'SemVer' scheme (mingw-w64)\nclang64/mingw-w64-clang-x86_64-w3c-mathml2 2.0-1\n    MathML XML scheme (mingw-w64)\nmsys/docbook-mathml 1.1CR1-1\n    MathML XML scheme\nmsys/docbook-xml 4.5-2 [installed]\n    A widely used XML scheme for writing documentation and help\nmsys/guile 2.2.7-1\n    a portable, embeddable Scheme implementation written in C\nmsys/libguile 2.2.7-1 (libraries) [installed]\n    a portable, embeddable Scheme implementation written in C\nmsys/libguile-devel 2.2.7-1 (development)\n    a portable, embeddable Scheme implementation written in C```","ts":"1629564132.059500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8k4n6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ca1a8802-45b8-4b8b-91b1-c9e62ea2904c","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://qiita.com/sym_num/items/e41e85447a9de61bf6b8\u003e\nLisp1.5ってなんぞと思ったら本当にLisp1.5だった。","ts":"1629563615.056400","attachments":[{"fallback":"Qiita: ElixirでLisp1.5を作ったお話 - Qiita","id":1,"title":"ElixirでLisp1.5を作ったお話 - Qiita","title_link":"https://qiita.com/sym_num/items/e41e85447a9de61bf6b8","text":"三つ子の魂百まで 昭和58年だったと思います。まだ20代前半の頃でした。中西正和先生のLispの本を買いました。まるで理解できませんでした（苦笑）。当時の版はM式で書かれていました。わからないながらもLispと付き合っていたら楽...","image_url":"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.qiita.com%2Fassets%2Fpublic%2Farticle-ogp-background-1150d8b18a7c15795b701a55ae908f94.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0\u0026w=1200\u0026mark64=aHR0cHM6Ly9xaWl0YS11c2VyLWNvbnRlbnRzLmltZ2l4Lm5ldC9-dGV4dD9peGxpYj1yYi00LjAuMCZ3PTg0MCZoPTM4MCZ0eHQ2ND1SV3hwZUdseTQ0R25UR2x6Y0RFdU5lT0NrdVM5bk9PQm8tT0JuLU9CaXVpcHNRJnR4dC1jb2xvcj0lMjMzMzMmdHh0LWZvbnQ9SGlyYWdpbm8lMjBTYW5zJTIwVzYmdHh0LXNpemU9NTQmdHh0LWNsaXA9ZWxsaXBzaX