o_rgb:222%2Cg_south_west%2Cl_text:notosansjp-medium.otf_37_bold:noriok%2Cx_203%2Cy_98/c_fit%2Cco_rgb:222%2Cg_north_west%2Cl_text:notosansjp-medium.otf_70_bold:Emacs%2520%25E5%2586%2585%25E9%2583%25A8%25E3%2581%25A7%2520gosh%2520%25E3%2582%2592%25E8%25B5%25B7%25E5%258B%2595%25E3%2581%2597%25E3%2581%25A6%2520Gauche%2520%25E3%2583%2597%25E3%2583%25AD%25E3%2582%25B0%25E3%2583%25A9%25E3%2583%259F%25E3%2583%25B3%25E3%2582%25B0%25E3%2582%2592%25E8%25A1%258C%25E3%2581%2586%2Cw_1010%2Cx_90%2Cy_100/g_south_west%2Ch_90%2Cl_fetch:aHR0cHM6Ly96ZW5uLWRldi5naXRodWIuaW8vZGVmYXVsdC1hdmF0YXJzL2Rhcmsvbi5zdmc=%2Cr_max%2Cw_90%2Cx_87%2Cy_72/v1627274783/default/og-base_z4sxah.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Zenn","service_icon":"https://zenn.dev/images/icon.png","from_url":"https://zenn.dev/noriok/articles/2020-09-25-gosh-in-emacs","original_url":"https://zenn.dev/noriok/articles/2020-09-25-gosh-in-emacs"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g5R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52e05820-8310-4564-bb0d-1f2808c6f872","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Lisp2はもちろんEmacs Lispで、Lisp1はEmacsの中でGaucheなど動いたはず","ts":"1629563412.054800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AEpt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19b74caf-3d98-4cbb-9426-c31e3daa9490","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"lisp1とかlisp2とかは総称で、lisp1という処理系があるわけじゃないですね。\n\u003chttps://scrapbox.io/zenwerk/Lisp1_%E3%81%A8_Lisp-2\u003e","ts":"1629563395.054400","attachments":[{"fallback":"zenwerk public: Lisp1 と Lisp-2 - zenwerk public","id":1,"title":"Lisp1 と Lisp-2 - zenwerk public","title_link":"https://scrapbox.io/zenwerk/Lisp1_%E3%81%A8_Lisp-2","text":"定義 Lisp1　→　関数と変数が同じ名前空過に属する　→　名前空間が１つ scheme, Python など Lisp2　→　関数と変数の名前空間が別れている　→　名前空間が２つ CommonLisp, Ruby, Smalltalk 名前空間の方式であり、Lisp限定の用語ではない Lisp1 Lisp1は print(\"hello world\") があったら、 print は変数参照式。 p","thumb_url":"https://scrapbox.io/assets/img/content-logo.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"zenwerk public","service_icon":"https://scrapbox.io/assets/img/favicon/apple-touch-icon.png","thumb_width":288,"thumb_height":288,"from_url":"https://scrapbox.io/zenwerk/Lisp1_%E3%81%A8_Lisp-2","original_url":"https://scrapbox.io/zenwerk/Lisp1_%E3%81%A8_Lisp-2"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ljm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6096a376-e205-4b8c-beb7-0e1768870d50","type":"message","user":"U022E2B9KRD","text":"もっと、お恥ずかしいのですが...\nlisp1, lisp2 系のコード動作確認は、Windows で、 MSYS2 とかで、何かをインストールすれば、出来るんですか？\n知識としてしっておきたいなぁと...\nemacs の `*scrach*` で、おまじないすれば、lisp1, lisp2 処理系使えたりするのでしょうか？","ts":"1629563350.054000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sXm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"097c3d15-5633-47c8-b81b-557336de20c9","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"処理系実装しているならそういうのこそ知っているべきだったんですよねぇ、お恥ずかしい","ts":"1629563062.049500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"kanzenrikai","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9gO4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aff9884d-be16-4d54-b8e8-6b0d52cf53e0","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"まぁこういうの理解度というよりコーナーケース芸人みたいなものなので。。","ts":"1629562992.048900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wPs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2b5c08e0-da49-408a-961c-30f726ce12b9","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ここになってLispに対する理解度の浅さが浮き彫りになってきている","ts":"1629562954.048700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8XYv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a05427f-5c6b-4727-87d4-2251b79f8acb","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":ba::njaku:","ts":"1629562943.048400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r+aV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"689017b4-2743-49bd-b7fd-94c528a7f906","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"Lisp2脳としてはlistをクオートしたい。\n```(apply 'list 1 2 '(3))\n;;=\u0026gt; (1 2 3)```","ts":"1629562819.048200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"76K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4523b2a4-726b-4073-bed9-791f41bf9385","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"昔作っていた処理系はapplyの仕様を誤解して実装していたことが発覚した","ts":"1629562801.047900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PjM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"665ccc0f-042d-4476-9951-0d3d1dd93c92","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"うぐぐ。。listが参照エラーで落ちそうだ。。(lisp2脳)","ts":"1629562780.047800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HT0gt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d0434258-0868-4fa1-be98-efe85133a44a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"```gosh\u0026gt; (apply list 1 2 '(3))\n(1 2 3)```\nGaucheでもちゃんとこうなるな","ts":"1629562728.047300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2cI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52c66479-96f7-460a-99e2-5a1c3b02f7dc","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"へぇー、この仕様は知らなかった(単純にリストを分解するだけだと思ってました)","ts":"1629562674.046900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5+3mP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65fc25e5-fbc0-496b-bc19-ceae995f7f02","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u0026gt; splicing\nそうですね。","ts":"1629562662.046600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DStdx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce7d8d1f-2c29-4436-b80f-637874e22abc","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ちなみに動作の違いはこれ。\napplyの場合、最後のリストを分配して `funcall` してくれる。\n```(defun fn (a b c)\n  (+ a b c))\n;;=\u0026gt; fn\n\n(apply #'fn '(1 2 3))\n;;=\u0026gt; 6\n\n(=\n (apply #'fn '(1 2 3))\n (apply #'fn 1 '(2 3))\n (apply #'fn 1 2 '(3))\n (apply #'fn 1 2 3 '()))\n;;=\u0026gt; t\n\n(funcall #'fn 1 2 3)\n;;=\u0026gt;6\n\n(funcall #'fn '(1 2 3))\n;;=\u0026gt; Debugger entered--Lisp error: (wrong-number-of-arguments ((t) (a b c) (+ a b c)) 1)\n;;     fn((1 2 3))\n;;     (progn (fn '(1 2 3)))\n;;     eval((progn (fn '(1 2 3))) t)```","ts":"1629562629.046300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oBF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ac422bea-39ed-4362-8d84-55cea53543d6","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"リストの中味をsplicingして食わせたいみたいな稀によくある需要を解消してくれるやつ","ts":"1629562477.046100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VeHW5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4710c624-0e80-494d-83c9-073de4c57098","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"Elisp3大謎、funcallとapplyの使い分け。","ts":"1629562405.045500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7bZJf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0e5f85ca-bb87-47d6-88a3-6d286022d8ea","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"なるほど、了解です。","ts":"1629562366.045300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u/KN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7645437c-9799-4155-bf13-deb1bb7a773a","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"あー。それは話の整合性としてapplyを使っただけですね。\nこの例だと普通はfuncallです。","ts":"1629562351.045000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7aMi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9706e01f-8294-44c6-9c48-613a036d6c42","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"そういえば、funcallじゃなくてapply派なんです？","ts":"1629562303.044800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1g8XH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e42576a-9f82-42b0-8062-72a4a3c8dde7","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"通常はこう書かないといけない。\n```(let ((fn (lambda (elm) (+ elm 1))))\n  (apply fn '(1)))\n;;=\u0026gt; 2```\n","ts":"1629562090.043900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"agP=u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"372d8e1b-c5e2-4442-ae99-a23adefdb08a","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ちなみにfletというのものがあり、applyを省略することもできる。 (Elispの場合は `cl-flet` )\n```(cl-flet ((fn (elm) (+ elm 1)))\n  (fn 1))\n;;=\u0026gt; 2```","ts":"1629562040.043600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"benri","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GXgk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"94065ffa-0585-4d22-b746-1b5954dc03f1","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"```* ((lambda (elm) (+ elm 1)) 1)\n2```\nCLでも動いたので、ElispのそれはCLからの輸入か。","ts":"1629561886.043400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7VjtA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1511807a-bea8-4e52-a9de-7683b9e6939e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"(Schemeも厳密にやるとマクロ空間を用意しないといけない)","ts":"1629561868.043200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4pZJm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6309d1cd-c29b-4ba3-96fc-c4e0684a15e5","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"もちろん存在判定はしないといけないので実際のコストに大差はないんだろうけどね","ts":"1629561832.042700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zlFsG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3957fe7c-2304-41a0-a050-e44a648cd69a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"処理系作ってた身からすると、Schemeの場合は一々関数部分を式として評価しないといけないのでそれをしなくてもいいLisp2はいいよなあみたいに思ってた","ts":"1629561790.042200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4U0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"89b52498-47d5-449c-98b6-8be81e5f1503","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"これがlisp2の世界。\n```(setq fn (lambda (elm) (+ elm 1)))\n;;=\u0026gt; (closure (t) (elm) (+ elm 1))\n\n(fn 1)\n;;=\u0026gt; Debugger entered--Lisp error: (void-function fn)\n;;     (fn 1)\n;;     (progn (fn 1))\n;;     eval((progn (fn 1)) t)```","ts":"1629561746.041700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desuyone","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fWC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5076b3bb-f15a-48a3-92c4-4af3179deafe","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":hee:","ts":"1629561671.040700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"anGw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a741a8a4-d9b9-404c-9dda-06bfb47ce16d","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ただ、Elispでもこういうのは動く。\nリテラルか、lambda式をとれるらしい。\n```((lambda (elm) (+ elm 1)) 1)\n;;=\u0026gt; 2```","ts":"1629561659.040500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TAQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b3deb68-2f88-4c26-8dfd-11827bd2594b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"LispはScheme出身なのでそういうのを面倒に感じちゃってたんですよね、名前空間は確かに大事だけど関数の可用性を犠牲にしてまで得るものなの？みたいな","ts":"1629561620.040300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/D3K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c0e9105-5b77-478e-ab33-d76710e37f74","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"関数名は ~シンボル~ リテラルなので評価されない。","ts":"1629561583.039600","edited":{"user":"UDPT2BZ6E","ts":"1629561683.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j1TaT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"afee373e-bebb-436c-945d-778c6dfa70a4","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"lisp2、いちいちapplyしないといけないというのはそう。","ts":"1629561570.039400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PW92F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"437382c7-a1f7-48da-8442-7c4f6f0aa1b3","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"たぶんそうです。","ts":"1629561557.039200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J9h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f564329-5a6b-42ca-a677-d321b48f0a3f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ラムダ計算とかそういう文脈かなぁ","ts":"1629561538.039000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EKST"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d60d805-1a2f-483a-9000-fb4992b8bf58","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"lisp1の方が数学的にはきれいらしい (出典不明)","ts":"1629561513.038500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7wC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"26889080-bb0b-47ee-84cb-9316a33e5484","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"グローバルに関数をひたすら置く言語とどうしても相性悪いですよね、lisp1は","ts":"1629561496.038200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"83Jqa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58cfead7-0390-467d-932a-e6ba0a849d62","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"Python、powも組み込み関数なので、消滅しがち。","ts":"1629561470.037700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xEXN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1054a152-c255-423c-b72e-0efbc7c71bd1","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"lisp2は最適化がしやすそうだなと感じる","ts":"1629561415.037400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SnHW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6d6caa17-316f-4aa8-b9b5-195f55d99e3b","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"私はlstを使います。別にElispでもlstを使いますが、心理的安全性を求めたくなる。","ts":"1629561414.037300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruho","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_origin